# From "Compoint" (Wave IV - Adventure, CD3-6) -- the third and shortest of
# the NVC exercises (after nvc-i.gws and nvc-ii.gws), aimed specifically at
# communicating with "those who know, understand, and love you" rather than
# open perception.

@segment  compoint
@title    Compoint
@levels   F12
@duration ~4m

say Now, in Focus 12, reach out and perceive communication from those who know, understand, and love you. Do it the nonverbal way — translating each word into a thought, and perceiving whatever answers.
pause 8
say Calm.
pause 4
say Curious.
pause 4
say Help.
pause 4
say Eager.
pause 4
say Hello.
pause 4
say Welcome.
pause 6
say Continue the exchange, in your own way. I'll call you when it's time to return.
hold 90
say Now, translate these too, nonverbally.
pause 5
say I must leave.
pause 5
say Goodbye.
pause 5
say Thank you.
pause 6
say You'll remember this in detail, and be able to put it into words once you're back.
pause 6
say Move now from Focus 12 to Focus 10.
pause 5
